                                            <constraint firstAttribute="width" constant="345" id="smz-AO-2ug"/>
                                        </constraints>
                                        <string key="text">Imagine a world where no farmer struggles to find the right tools. Need a tractor for sowing season? Get it delivered to your farm. Looking for a superseder? Find one instantly.
